sequenceDiagram
    actor User as 👤 用户
    participant CLI as cli.py
    participant Orch as ReviewOrchestrator
    participant Pool as ThreadPoolExecutor
    participant Mem as MemoryTools

    User->>CLI: python cli.py batch-review --prs prs.txt --workers 3

    CLI->>CLI: 读取 prs.txt (跳过空行和 # 注释行)
    Note over CLI: 解析出 N 个 PR 标识

    CLI->>Orch: batch_review(pr_list, max_workers=3)

    Orch->>Pool: ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=3)
    Note over Pool: 🔴 面试重点: 并发控制<br/>每个 worker 创建独立的<br/>AgentRunner → LLM API 调用<br/>trajectory 文件按 session_id 隔离

    par Worker 1
        Pool->>Orch: review(pr_1)
    and Worker 2
        Pool->>Orch: review(pr_2)
    and Worker 3
        Pool->>Orch: review(pr_3)
    end

    Note over Pool: concurrent.futures.as_completed

    Orch-->>CLI: list[ReviewResult]

    CLI-->>User: ✓/✗ 统计输出

    User->>CLI: python cli.py health-report --repo owner/repo

    CLI->>Orch: generate_health_report("owner/repo")

    Orch->>Mem: get_repo_patterns("owner/repo")
    Note over Mem: 从 review_memory.jsonl<br/>加载 repo_pattern 类型记录

    Mem-->>Orch: patterns list

    Orch->>Orch: 按 severity 分组 (critical/high/medium/low)<br/>按 occurrence_count 降序排列<br/>统计 Top 10 受影响文件

    Orch-->>CLI: Markdown 健康报告

    CLI-->>User: 终端或文件输出报告